<title>USA: MasTec sets 3-for-2 stock split.</title>
<headline>MasTec sets 3-for-2 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>MIAMI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>MasTec Inc said it has set a three-for-two stock split in the form of a stock dividend on its about 17 million shares of common stock outstanding.</p>
<p>The dividend, which will pay one share of common stock for each two shares of common stock outstanding will be paid February 28, record February 3.</p>
</text>
